gaqs(){return"Allow notifications for Band Calendar in your browser\u2019s site settings or your device\u2019s Notifications settings. Then return here and press Check again. The app cannot directly restore blocked permission."},
gaqu(){return"Use an up-to-date browser and open the Band Calendar HTTPS address directly, avoiding browsers inside other apps. On iPhone and iPad, open the web app from your Home Screen. If the problem persists, reload the app and press Check again."},
